                                                "sense_id": "31fee554-e5b9-37cb-8c06-e9482d7a5301",
                                                "text": "The technical term for the event is “coupling,” but it is known colloquially as the “Shinkansen kiss.” For Japanese rail fans, it’s a big deal. For foreigners, it is a unique insight into the quintessentially Japanese experience of trainspotting."
